## ✅ Post-Promotion Health Checks

Always verify a Domain Controller's health after promotion before joining clients to the network.

# Check 1: Verify Core AD Services are Running
Get-Service -Name adws, dns, kdc
* adws: Active Directory Web Services (Allows management tools to connect).
* dns: DNS Server (Required for clients to locate the domain).
* kdc: Kerberos Key Distribution Center (Handles authentication/passwords).

# Check 2: Verify DNS Service (SRV) Records
Resolve-DnsName -Name _ldap._tcp.dc._msdcs.corp.local -Type SRV
* This ensures that when a computer asks "Who handles logins?", DNS correctly points to this server's hostname and Static IP on Port 389 (LDAP).

